# exp 114 — 5-asset confirmation of concave √-impact (δ=0.5). Bonferroni m=5, α=0.01.

asset     base_hill d050_hill d050_acf2   Δnet    p_net cohen_d  δ*_fit  GATE
spx           1.522     2.926     0.376  +1.27   0.0014   +0.90   0.488     ✓
ndx           1.344     3.251     0.365  +0.97   0.0065   +0.75   0.589    ns
gold          1.381     2.917     0.427  +0.70   0.0507   +0.53   0.492    ns
eurusd        1.307     3.224     0.380  +0.63   0.0620   +0.50   0.658    ns
btcusdt       1.226     3.002     0.376  +1.27   0.0002   +1.07   0.500     ✓

# pooled per-fact in-band % (all assets) — collateral check
  hill_tail_index                7 ->   81  (+73pp) <-tail
  acf_squared_returns           68 ->   66  (-2pp)
  aggregational_gaussianity     36 ->   52  (+16pp)
  dfa_hurst_abs_r               44 ->   41  (-3pp)
  autocorr_returns               0 ->   13  (+13pp)
  intermittency_fano           100 ->  100  (+0pp)
  leverage_effect                7 ->    5  (-1pp)
  gain_loss_asymmetry           59 ->   53  (-6pp)
  volume_volatility_corr        97 ->   98  (+1pp)
  zumbach_asymmetry              3 ->    8  (+5pp)
  conditional_kurtosis           2 ->    2  (+0pp)

  worst single-fact Δ = -6pp  → collateral gate PASS
  SOLVE-CONFIRMED iff d050 gate ✓ on ≥4/5 assets AND collateral PASS. → 2/5 assets passed.
  δ*_fit ≈ 0.5 across assets ⇒ the TLB √-law crossing is UNIVERSAL (the headline).

